scenario bat sensor lost during a torch event: YIELD holds until FAULT, never above the floor
selector clear
boot
within 9 state == DARK_IDLE
hand 1
wait 3
torch 5
within 1.0 state == YIELD
sensor 0                       # the driver reports the chip lost at once
wait 0.5
expect state == YIELD          # the last valid reading still says another light is there
expect level == floor
within 1.0 state == FAULT
expect level == floor
expect event_fmm > 0           # the event ended with the sensor: what was measured is charged
